id: grenade
name: Grenade
kind: gear
tags: tech
craftDC: Qualified
# "The Damage Attribute for that Attacking Maneuver is the Recorded Ingenuity" - the maker's, recorded
# when it is given, the way the Bomb's is, and editable on the Item.
records: ingenuity
# Its Details. Consumable: "destroyed once it is used" - thrown, it is gone.
details: technology, consumable
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Thrown with the Throw Maneuver: a Minor Sphere around the target, the Recorded Ingenuity as the
  Damage Attribute, and the Grenade is gone afterwards (Consumable).
text: >
  Grenade [Tech]: A hand-held explosive that you lob at an enemy.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Details: Technology, Consumable
  –Effects: When using the Throw Maneuver, that Attacking Maneuver has a Minor Sphere AoE (centered
  on the initial target of this Maneuver) and the Damage Attribute for that Attacking Maneuver is
  the Recorded Ingenuity.

---

# --- What is built -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Recorded Ingenuity: taken off the character when they are given it, shown and editable on
# the Item.
#
# Thrown with the Throw Maneuver: the attack has a Minor Sphere AoE centred on the one it was
# thrown at - the others it catches added from the card, as for any Area - the recorded
# Ingenuity stands in for the Damage Attribute, as a Bomb's does, and the Grenade - Consumable -
# is taken off the character once the attack is made. See thrownAs() in module/gear.mjs.
